        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:22]</p>\n<div data-visibility=\"gm\"><hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effect (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> [[/r 3d8[negative]]] damage and regains half as many Hit Points from all healing (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> as stage 2 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> [[/r 3d8[negative]]] damage and gains no benefit from healing (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> as stage 4 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 6</strong> dead, and rises as a @Compendium[pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary.VC7rtYR4hLxwg7WZ]{Ghast} the next midnight</p>\n</div>"
